The decision to remove tonsils happens,

00:09:39.830 --> 00:09:42.207
A, how often you get strep infections,

00:09:42.207 --> 00:09:45.036
B, lifestyle issues that can come about

00:09:45.036 --> 00:09:47.000
as a result of inflamed tonsils,

00:09:47.000 --> 00:09:49.134
and C, a conversation between
a doctor and their patient.

00:09:49.134 --> 00:09:51.860
Katelyn'sWorld, every time I
bend down or move my knees,

00:09:51.860 --> 00:09:52.890
most of the time they crack.

00:09:52.890 --> 00:09:54.590
Is this okay or should I get
it checked out by a doctor?

00:09:54.590 --> 00:09:56.992
- Your knees should be sagging

00:09:56.992 --> 00:09:59.810
at least slightly during the day.

00:09:59.810 --> 00:10:02.193
I would add, that your
hips should be sagging,

00:10:02.193 --> 00:10:04.281
at least sightly as well,

00:10:04.281 --> 00:10:08.083
possibly more so to get your
hips a little more support.

00:10:09.000 --> 00:10:10.020
- Forgive me, maybe the only thing

00:10:10.020 --> 00:10:11.029
this robot could be saying is that

00:10:11.029 --> 00:10:12.330
when you're taking a step,

00:10:12.330 --> 00:10:13.565
you should be bending at
the knees and the hips

00:10:13.565 --> 00:10:15.080
in order to absorb shock.

00:10:15.080 --> 00:10:16.620
I'm obviously reaching there.

00:10:16.620 --> 00:10:19.320
My knees crack all the time,
it's no big deal for me.

00:10:19.320 --> 00:10:20.190
But that being said,

00:10:20.190 --> 00:10:22.031
there are certain conditions
like a tear of the meniscus,

00:10:22.031 --> 00:10:25.105
which can cause locking and
cracking sensations of the knee.

00:10:25.105 --> 00:10:28.130
So it really depends on what
other symptoms are present.

00:10:28.130 --> 00:10:30.228
All these things are really
important to check and evaluate

00:10:30.228 --> 00:10:33.965
using special tests with the
art of the physical exam.

00:10:33.965 --> 00:10:36.292
I challenged Brad Mando to pick my outfits

00:10:36.292 --> 00:10:38.171
and the results were not so great,

00:10:38.171 --> 00:10:39.850
but really interesting to watch.

